      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it's hard to reach out when you don't even feel like a person. like, how can a person be helped if they're just a malfunction? it feels more like a system failure than a mental health thing. like a line of code that just needs to be deleted so the rest of the program can run clean. do you think that's even possible? for something to just... be removed to make everything else stable again?",
